  m_Name: unit_810958
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Burning Grudge Mariano
  unitId: 810958
  unitNumber: 8639
  description: Mariano and his gang had laid two traps for the girl with the gun
    relic. Once he realized that the assassin sent out to kill the girl as part of
    his first plan had failed, he took hostage a boy belonging to a tribe of local
    sanctuary guardians, and then waited for his prey. However, that plan failed
    as well, and he was ultimately forced to fight her face to face. Although Mariano
    was quite skilled in combat, he was no match for the girl with the gun relic
    and her comrades in arms. Following his gang's bitter loss he was arrested by
    the sheriff, but was able to break free during a scuffle on their way to the
    county jail. This allowed him to rendezvous with his lover and escape into the
    sunset.
  summonDesc: Well, well. Guess now you're a hotshot too, huh?<br>But don't forget,
    the only person who gets to order me around is my lady.<br>Got it?
  fusionDesc: So you're quite the fighter, eh?<br>Alright then, let's call it a draw.<br>What
    is it you want from me? Just name it.
  evoDesc: There's nothing left to do here.<br>Time to hit the next town.<br>This
    is goodbye, so you're on your own now, kid.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
